==Restrictions==
Max # of Deployable Cats: 1

==Battleground==
*1 [[Shadow Boxer K]] spawns as the boss after 6.67 seconds<sup>200f</sup>.
*1 [[Camelle]] spawns as the boss after 3.33 seconds<sup>100f</sup>.
*1 [[Kory]] spawns as the boss.
*Infinite [[Assassin Bear]]s spawn after 900 seconds<sup>27,000f</sup>, delay 900 seconds<sup>27,000f</sup>.

==Strategy==
Similar to previous stages, simply using [[Crazy Hearts (Combo)|Crazy Hearts]] and spawning [[Bahamut Cat (Special Cat)|Awakened Bahamut]] is enough to clear this stage, since they can one or two shot all bosses here.

